<p>Von wem sagt die Erped. d. Bl.   <note><hi rendition="#right">268</hi> </note>  </p>           </div><lb/>
<milestone rendition="#hr" unit="section"/><lb/>
<div type="jAn">       <head><hi rendition="#c #fr">Strickmaschinen,</hi></head><lb/>
